# Local agent scratch, handoff notes, team protocol state and packaging output.
# None of these is a build input for docker/Dockerfile.* — they only bloat the
# transfer to the daemon.
.qoder
.qoder-scratch
_handoffs
dist-package
docs/reviews
# Local tool caches and Finder metadata inside the workspace dirs. The lines
# above are root-only, so they miss backend/ and frontend/, where
# "COPY frontend/ ./frontend/" ships the traces into the builder layer. Nothing
# here is a build input: ruff, turbo and tsc regenerate each of them on demand,
# and three of these files carry absolute paths of this machine.
**/.ruff_cache
**/.hermes
**/.video_agent
**/.zcode
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
